{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在音乐细节、情绪转折的微妙层次和随乐句推进的即时对应上明显不如X，尤其少了不少只有在特定音乐时刻才出现的细腻感受。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分区让人可以先沿着左侧读出完整的心理变化，再从右侧获得感受补充，观看路径比较稳定，适合一边听音乐一边扫屏幕。X的重点加亮确实更容易瞬间抓住人物每段的核心动机，而且音乐细节和情绪层次更丰富，但话与感受交替出现，加上大量不同意象和细碎提示，容易让注意力在局部之间来回切换。综合普通观众在限定时间里的理解效率、叙事连贯性和实际观看体验，我选Y，但它牺牲了一部分X非常有价值的音乐对应和细腻表达。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ad931cd5-9ab3-46d9-bfe5-17ca73fe2daf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T231326262776Z", "elapsed_seconds": 79.375, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:14:45.650116+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4a74f365dc92ba47cc16dbc48fbc8af2101c00fef59f410f8ea4286abbc051ba", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683",